id: pm-lint-criterion-witnesses
title: Validate declared acceptance criterion witnesses without executing code
description: "Lint an explicit versioned criterion-to-evidence contract using certified SDK item reads. Keep dangling, stale and contradictory witnesses distinct and preserve exact citation paths in plain directories."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-22T16:06:03.295Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-23T15:32:33.998Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-23T15:32:33.366Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-23T15:32:33.366Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "Dangling, stale and contradictory witnesses are distinct; Plain-directory fixtures retain exact citation paths; Typed SDK and CLI expose compact TOON and JSON with actionable refusals; Read-only public tracker validation and npm plus Bun CI release gates are recorded"
comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T16:06:45.405Z",codex-agent,"Overlap recheck: installed core SDK and LINKED_TEST_EDITS.md own linked-test declaration, mutation and execution; core splitAcceptanceCriteria owns semicolon boundaries and certified listAllComplete owns complete tracker reads. pm-context README describes deterministic context packs and receipt usage. pm-review owns GitHub review rounds. None exposes a declared per-criterion witness lint contract. Scope: add a strict versioned sidecar contract, read-only lint witnesses command and typed SDK; do not run linked commands, infer proof from prose, or duplicate core criteria parsing. Existing PML002 remains authoring-quality presence checking."
  "2026-10-22T16:12:34.660Z",codex-agent,"Implementation uses SDK splitAcceptanceCriteria and certifyCompleteListResult(listAllComplete), and reuses canonical sourceDigest for complete linked-test metadata. A strict version 1 sidecar binds exact criterion text to command+digest, file citation+byte digest, or pending reason. All criteria, including terminal history, remain in scope. Pending never passes. Source item/comment prose is never inferred as proof. Observation paths retain exact spelling while resolved containment rejects traversal and symlink escapes. Focused coverage reached 100 percent in all four dimensions for both new modules. CLI integration exposed that read_output refusal receipts must retain the declared findings array; included it so typed remedies survive host rendering."
  "2026-10-22T16:18:06.728Z",codex-agent,"Public-data validation: public pm-context main snapshot 7d156cd179b1a02a4023d0c8690dcba7d8594c81, 80 certified items, 46 with criteria, 176 criteria, 82 linked tests (not executed). Non-git read-only snapshot, empty executable PATH, 167 of 167 tracker-file hashes unchanged. Empty contract: 176 missing and exit 1. Generated explicit-pending sidecar: 176 pending, zero missing and exit 1. No existing tests or prose were inferred as proof. Behavioral revert: disable finding emission within lintWitnesses only and rebuild; targeted SDK state regression and built CLI exact-citation regression both fail (0 pass, 2 fail). Restored original function and rebuilt. Pinned SDK writer gap: path-only LinkedTest is valid in the public type/read model but create --test and test --add-json both demand a command; a real SDK imported tracker fixture verifies legacy path-only support without changing the dependency pin."
  "2026-10-22T16:21:23.119Z",codex-agent,"Local verification: pm test --run --progress passed both linked commands: 23 targeted tests (zero failures/skips) plus typecheck, lint, zero-duplication and 60/60 documented declarations. Focused witness coverage: nine tests, 100/100/100/100 across both new modules. Initial linked run exposed inherited source-workspace coordinates in a nested CLI fixture; fixture now explicitly isolates workspace and global-profile coordinates and the repeated linked run passes. CI now calls the exact npm release:check entrypoint instead of duplicating its component steps, retains explicit identity enforcement and the Node 22/26 matrix, and retains the Bun release:check gate on Node 26. Full gates run in CI to respect the saturated host."
  "2026-10-22T16:26:14.370Z",codex-agent,"PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-lint/pull/19 is ready for review. Full CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-lint/actions/runs/39813454883 passed on implementation commit f9d5a03b965ef1e072c169e44c0496a370ad1ffa: npm run release:check on Node 22 and Node 26, bun run release:check on Node 26. Each gate passed 97 suite tests plus 1 packed npm/npx and native Bun/bunx acceptance test, with zero suite failures/skips. Each measured all 19 authored source files at 100/100/100/100, 60 documented declarations, zero duplication and all remaining release checks. CodeQL also passed. Current installed CLI 2026.10.22 public docs and SDK declarations were rechecked: graph witnesses are unrelated and no criterion-to-evidence contract API overlaps this feature. Core and sibling ownership remains as recorded. Automated review is not approval: CodeRabbit skipped automatic review, Sourcery reported budget exhaustion and cubic was neutral; no review was requested with mentions. Releasing the claim without closing the item; final tracker-only head will receive a fresh exact-head CI run."
  "2026-10-22T18:32:13.359Z",codex-agent,"Review round: fetched remote head 083c27b and all unresolved review threads with complete comments; branch includes current main, so no merge is needed. One unresolved finding PRRT_kwDOVHTnEc6vUdVT is valid: localeCompare collates distinct canonical-equivalent Unicode strings equally and can preserve declaration order. Latest CodeRabbit review has no outside-diff findings. Plan: exact UTF-16 ordering for each finding identity field, real plain-directory SDK regression with reversed criteria/witness declarations, behavioral revert proof, and full npm plus Bun release gates. Whole-PR self-review: parser and digest key sorting already use default exact ordering; no other newly introduced locale-dependent production sort was found. No thread replies or resolutions will be sent."
  "2026-10-22T18:35:42.133Z",codex-agent,"Fixed review thread PRRT_kwDOVHTnEc6vUdVT in code: finding rows compare exact UTF-16 item_id, criterion, citation and state, with no locale collation or normalization. Remedy is state-derived, so these fields completely distinguish rendered rows. Regression uses real plain-directory SDK trackers with composed/decomposed criteria and file citations, reversed bindings/witnesses, multiple item ids and duplicate identical rows. Behavioral revert proof: restore only compareWitnessText to localeCompare and rebuild; node --test --test-name-pattern=\"witness ordering uses exact strings\" test/witnesses.test.ts fails with 0 passed/1 failed at declaration-order equality. Restore exact comparator and rebuild: all 10 witness tests pass, with 100/100/100/100 focused coverage. Typecheck, lint, zero duplication and docstring gate pass. Whole diff reviewed for this class; canonical parser/digest key ordering is already exact, and no other new locale-dependent sort remains. Full release gates will be checked in CI at unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-10-22T18:40:09.107Z",codex-agent,"Review fix full-gate receipt: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-lint/actions/runs/39832822979 passed on 794ca294047380775900769bb43536620a94852b. npm run release:check on Node 22 and 26 and bun run release:check on Node 26 each passed 98 suite tests plus 1 packed npm/npx and native Bun/bunx acceptance test, with zero suite failures/skips, 100/100/100/100 coverage across 19 authored sources, zero duplication and all other release checks. No local load timeouts occurred; full gates used CI under the original saturated-host constraint. The one unresolved review thread is fixed in code and deliberately left unreplied/unresolved as instructed. No outside-diff findings were present. Releasing the work claim without closing; final receipt-only head will be gated again."
  "2026-10-23T15:32:23.327Z",codex-agent,"DELIVERED: merged PR #19 (6111a2a33c109985057ab65a62e01770f44345b2) is an ancestor of audited main 8346efab4bb7d778adf3151e442105eb692d3f97. Inspected on main: test/witnesses.test.ts, docs/witness-validation.md. Real plain trackers distinguish dangling/stale/contradictory witnesses and exact citation paths; commands never execute linked code, Unicode order is exact, typed compact SDK/CLI/public-copy and full npm/Bun CI are recorded. This tracker audit inspected existing tests/files; it does not claim a new full product test run."
